      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEAST ROYALE (3) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 3 lengths at this track in a handy 30.56 beating VERACIOUS VAL. Draws to advantage and goes well over this trip. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from six starts. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. VERACIOUS VAL (1) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished in the money last time though when second (30.77) at this track. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Has a strong record out of this box with five wins and three minor placings from 11 starts. Expected to feature again. GOLDSTAR BECKS (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (31.32) in a P5 at this track. Likely to be about the mark. FEDERAL EMERAN (7) is a last-start placegetter worth considering.",
